<title>FRANCE: Clarins nine month sales up 15.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Clarins nine month sales up 15.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 2,143    vs    1,851</p>
<p>    -- of which third quarter		    658    vs	601</p>
<p>NOTE - Clarins said in the BALO official bulletin that on a like-for-like basis the nine month sales figure was up 6.7 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
